      <title>从零搭建极客博客：用 Hexo 打造个人技术笔记站</title>
      <link href="/Myblog/2026/08/08/%E4%BB%8E%E9%9B%B6%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%9E%81%E5%AE%A2%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8-Hexo-%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E7%AB%99/"/>
      <url>/Myblog/2026/08/08/%E4%BB%8E%E9%9B%B6%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%9E%81%E5%AE%A2%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%EF%BC%9A%E7%94%A8-Hexo-%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E7%AB%99/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="前言：为什么要建个人博客？"><a href="#前言：为什么要建个人博客？" class="headerlink" title="前言：为什么要建个人博客？"></a>前言：为什么要建个人博客？</h2><p>在这个信息爆炸的时代，我始终相信：<strong>最好的学习方式是教别人，而最好的教别人方式是写下来。</strong></p><p>在浏览了大量技术博客（比如 <a href="https://itsa1right.ink/">itsa1right.ink</a>、<a href="https://blog.yanxisishi.top/">blog.yanxisishi.top</a>）之后，我决定搭建一个属于自己的极客笔记站。经过调研，我选择了以下技术栈：</p><span id="more"></span><table><thead><tr><th>组件</th><th>选择</th><th>理由</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>框架</td><td><strong>Hexo</strong></td><td>快速、简洁、Node.js 生态</td></tr><tr><td>主题</td><td><strong>Icarus</strong></td><td>卡片风格、响应式、高度可定制</td></tr><tr><td>评论</td><td><strong>Giscus</strong></td><td>基于 GitHub Discussions，无需后端</td></tr><tr><td>部署</td><td><strong>GitHub Pages</strong></td><td>免费、稳定、与 Git 工作流无缝集成</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="环境准备"><a href="#环境准备" class="headerlink" title="环境准备"></a>环境准备</h2><h3 id="必要软件"><a href="#必要软件" class="headerlink" title="必要软件"></a>必要软件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证 Node.js（建议 v18+）</span></span><br><span class="line">node -v   <span class="comment"># v18.x.x</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证 npm</span></span><br><span class="line">npm -v    <span class="comment"># 9.x.x</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 验证 Git</span></span><br><span class="line">git -v    <span class="comment"># 2.x.x</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>Node.js</strong>：<a href="https://nodejs.org(下载/">https://nodejs.org（下载</a> LTS 版本）</li><li><strong>Git</strong>：<a href="https://git-scm.com/">https://git-scm.com</a></li></ul><hr><h2 id="第一步：初始化-Hexo-项目"><a href="#第一步：初始化-Hexo-项目" class="headerlink" title="第一步：初始化 Hexo 项目"></a>第一步：初始化 Hexo 项目</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 全局安装 Hexo CLI（只需一次）</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 在工作目录初始化博客</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo init my-blog</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> my-blog</span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 启动本地预览</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>打开 <code>http://localhost:4000</code> 即可看到默认博客。</p><hr><h2 id="第二步：配置-Icarus-主题"><a href="#第二步：配置-Icarus-主题" class="headerlink" title="第二步：配置 Icarus 主题"></a>第二步：配置 Icarus 主题</h2><p>Icarus 是一款简洁、响应式的卡片风格主题，非常适合技术博客。</p><h3 id="安装主题"><a href="#安装主题" class="headerlink" title="安装主题"></a>安装主题</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-theme-icarus hexo-renderer-inferno</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="修改主配置-config-yml"><a href="#修改主配置-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="修改主配置 _config.yml"></a>修改主配置 <code>_config.yml</code></h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">极客笔记</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">subtitle:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;Geek Notes&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">description:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;一个极客的技术笔记与知识分享站&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">author:</span> <span class="string">你的名字</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">timezone:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;Asia/Shanghai&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">https://yourname.github.io/yourrepo</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">icarus</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="配置-GitHub-Pages-部署"><a href="#配置-GitHub-Pages-部署" class="headerlink" title="配置 GitHub Pages 部署"></a>配置 GitHub Pages 部署</h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/yourname/yourrepo.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">main</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p><strong>踩坑提醒</strong>：不要使用 SSH 地址（<code>git@github.com...</code>），除非你已经配置好 SSH 密钥。HTTPS 更简单，国内用 Clash 代理 7897 端口即可正常连接 GitHub。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="第三步：创建-Icarus-主题配置"><a href="#第三步：创建-Icarus-主题配置" class="headerlink" title="第三步：创建 Icarus 主题配置"></a>第三步：创建 Icarus 主题配置</h2><p>在博客根目录创建 <code>_config.icarus.yml</code>。这是最关键的一步！</p><h3 id="核心配置片段"><a href="#核心配置片段" class="headerlink" title="核心配置片段"></a>核心配置片段</h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">version:</span> <span class="number">5.1</span><span class="number">.0</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">variant:</span> <span class="string">default</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">logo:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">text:</span> <span class="string">极客笔记</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">navbar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">首页:</span> <span class="string">/</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">归档:</span> <span class="string">/archives</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">分类:</span> <span class="string">/categories</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">标签:</span> <span class="string">/tags</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">友链:</span> <span class="string">/links</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">关于:</span> <span class="string">/about</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">links:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">GitHub:</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">icon:</span> <span class="string">fab</span> <span class="string">fa-github</span></span><br><span class="line">      <span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/yourname</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Giscus 评论（详见下一步）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">comment:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">giscus</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">yourname/yourrepo</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repoId:</span> <span class="string">R_kgDOXXXXXX</span>         <span class="comment"># 从 giscus.app 获取</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">category:</span> <span class="string">Announcements</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">categoryId:</span> <span class="string">DIC_kwDOXXXXXX</span>    <span class="comment"># 从 giscus.app 获取</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mapping:</span> <span class="string">pathname</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">strict:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">reactionsEnabled:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">inputPosition:</span> <span class="string">top</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">noborder_light</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">lang:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 侧边栏</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">sidebar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">left:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">sticky:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">right:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">sticky:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p><strong>避坑</strong>：<code>repoId</code> 是驼峰命名（repoId），不是 <code>repo_id</code>！Icarus 对字段名非常严格，写错会校验失败。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="第四步：配置-Giscus-评论"><a href="#第四步：配置-Giscus-评论" class="headerlink" title="第四步：配置 Giscus 评论"></a>第四步：配置 Giscus 评论</h2><p>最初我想用 <strong>Valine</strong>（基于 LeanCloud），但发现 LeanCloud 现在对个人开发者限制很多，注册和使用都很麻烦。</p><p>经过对比，我选择了 <strong>Giscus</strong>：基于 GitHub Discussions，完全免费，无需数据库。</p><h3 id="开启步骤"><a href="#开启步骤" class="headerlink" title="开启步骤"></a>开启步骤</h3><ol><li><p>进入你的 GitHub 仓库，开启 <strong>Discussions</strong>：<br><code>https://github.com/yourname/repo/discussions</code> → 点击 “Set up discussions”</p></li><li><p>访问 <a href="https://giscus.app,用/">https://giscus.app，用</a> GitHub 登录，选择你的仓库，按提示操作</p></li><li><p>页面会生成一段 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 代码，从中提取：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">data-repo-id=&quot;R_xxxxx&quot;      ← repoId</span><br><span class="line">data-category-id=&quot;DIC_xxxxx&quot; ← categoryId</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>填入 <code>_config.icarus.yml</code> 即可</p></li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>优点</strong>：访客用 GitHub 账号登录即可评论，无需额外认证<br><strong>缺点</strong>：评论者必须有 GitHub 账号</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="第五步：美化定制"><a href="#第五步：美化定制" class="headerlink" title="第五步：美化定制"></a>第五步：美化定制</h2><p>为了让博客更有极客感，我做了以下定制：</p><h3 id="日夜模式切换"><a href="#日夜模式切换" class="headerlink" title="日夜模式切换"></a>日夜模式切换</h3><p>在 <code>source/css/pluto-custom.css</code> 中定义 CSS 变量：</p><figure class="highlight css"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="selector-pseudo">:root</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">--pluto-bg</span>: <span class="built_in">linear-gradient</span>(<span class="number">180deg</span>, <span class="number">#e8f4fd</span> <span class="number">0%</span>, <span class="number">#b8e2f7</span> <span class="number">50%</span>, <span class="number">#f8f9fb</span> <span class="number">100%</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">--pluto-text</span>: <span class="number">#1a1a2e</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="selector-attr">[data-theme=<span class="string">&quot;dark&quot;</span>]</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">--pluto-bg</span>: <span class="built_in">radial-gradient</span>(ellipse at top, <span class="number">#0b1026</span> <span class="number">0%</span>, <span class="number">#1a1a2e</span> <span class="number">60%</span>, <span class="number">#050510</span> <span class="number">100%</span>);</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">--pluto-text</span>: <span class="number">#e6edf3</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="selector-tag">body</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">background</span>: <span class="built_in">var</span>(--pluto-bg) <span class="meta">!important</span>;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">background-attachment</span>: fixed <span class="meta">!important</span>;</span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attribute">transition</span>: background <span class="number">0.6s</span> ease;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>右上角放置一个切换按钮，将偏好存入 <code>localStorage</code>，下次打开记住选择。</p><h3 id="动态背景"><a href="#动态背景" class="headerlink" title="动态背景"></a>动态背景</h3><ul><li><strong>白天</strong>：漂浮的半透明云朵，缓慢穿越屏幕</li><li><strong>夜晚</strong>：闪烁的星星 + 定期划过的流星</li></ul><h3 id="鼠标粒子特效"><a href="#鼠标粒子特效" class="headerlink" title="鼠标粒子特效"></a>鼠标粒子特效</h3><p>参考 <a href="https://itsa1right.ink/">itsa1right.ink</a> 的光标拖尾效果，在 <code>source/js/pluto-cursor.js</code> 中实现：</p><ul><li>移动鼠标时生成发光粒子</li><li>粒子随时间衰减消失</li><li>点击时触发粒子爆炸效果</li><li>暗黑模式下粒子变为蓝白色调</li></ul><h3 id="首页英雄区"><a href="#首页英雄区" class="headerlink" title="首页英雄区"></a>首页英雄区</h3><p>创建一个静态 <code>source/index.html</code> 作为首页，包含：</p><ul><li>带旋转渐变光环的头像</li><li>打字机循环的标语</li><li>技能标签徽章</li><li>打字光标特效</li></ul><hr><h2 id="第六步：部署上线"><a href="#第六步：部署上线" class="headerlink" title="第六步：部署上线"></a>第六步：部署上线</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 一键清理 + 生成 + 部署</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo deploy --generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="遇到-Connection-reset？"><a href="#遇到-Connection-reset？" class="headerlink" title="遇到 Connection reset？"></a>遇到 Connection reset？</h3><p>国内访问 GitHub 经常出现网络问题。如果你在用 <strong>Clash</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global http.proxy http://127.0.0.1:7897</span><br><span class="line">git config --global https.proxy http://127.0.0.1:7897</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="遇到-Author-identity-unknown？"><a href="#遇到-Author-identity-unknown？" class="headerlink" title="遇到 Author identity unknown？"></a>遇到 Author identity unknown？</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global user.name <span class="string">&quot;你的名字&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.email <span class="string">&quot;你的邮箱&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="开启-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#开启-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="开启 GitHub Pages"></a>开启 GitHub Pages</h3><p>进入仓库 Settings → Pages → Source 选择 <code>Deploy from a branch</code> → Branch 选 <code>main</code> → Save</p><p>等待 1-2 分钟，访问 <code>https://yourname.github.io/yourrepo</code> 即可看到博客。</p><hr><h2 id="日常写作流程"><a href="#日常写作流程" class="headerlink" title="日常写作流程"></a>日常写作流程</h2><p>以后每次写文章只需要三步：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. 创建新文章</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo new <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2. 用编辑器打开 source/_posts/文章标题.md 写作</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    文章头部可以加分类和标签：</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    ---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    title: 文章标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    date: 2026-08-08</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    tags: [标签1, 标签2]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    categories: [分类名]</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">#    ---</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3. 部署上线</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo deploy --generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="踩坑记录"><a href="#踩坑记录" class="headerlink" title="踩坑记录"></a>踩坑记录</h2><table><thead><tr><th>问题</th><th>原因</th><th>解决方案</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Connection was reset</code></td><td>国内网络无法访问 GitHub</td><td>配置 Clash 代理到 Git</td></tr><tr><td><code>Author identity unknown</code></td><td>Git 全局身份未配置</td><td><code>git config --global user.name/email</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>RepoId not found</code></td><td>配置文件用了 <code>repo_id</code> 而非 <code>repoId</code></td><td>改用驼峰命名 <code>repoId</code></td></tr><tr><td>首页 404</td><td>所有文章删除后 Hexo 不生成 index</td><td>至少保留一篇文章或创建静态 HTML</td></tr><tr><td>友链页 404</td><td>Icarus 没有 <code>layout: links</code></td><td>改用 <code>layout: page</code></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="写在最后"><a href="#写在最后" class="headerlink" title="写在最后"></a>写在最后</h2><p>搭建这个博客的过程本身就是一次很好的学习。从最初对 Hexo 一窍不通，到解决 Git 认证、网络代理、主题配置等一个个问题，每一步都让我对这个技术栈理解更深。</p><p>如果你也想搭建自己的技术博客，希望这篇文章能帮你少走一些弯路。</p><p><strong>种一棵树最好的时间是十年前，其次是现在。</strong></p><p>开始写你的第一篇技术笔记吧。</p>]]></content>
      
      
